[[2047,31,8,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The supply for the check module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               reaches\npin 2 directly from the battery. (maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up\nto 2/99 or of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99 ) through fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10